### ==================== 变量 ====================
# 先用 loginTest.http 的用例1或2登录，拿到 token 替换下面
# 关注者（自己）的 userId 由 token 决定，被关注者从下面 followedUserId 取
@token = 331509ef-0027-41c1-bab4-4e1e255dc4e0



### ==================== 关注测试 ====================

### 1. 正常关注 — 关注另一个用户
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=2


### 2. 正常取关 — 取消关注
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/remove
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=2


### ==================== 异常 — 重复操作 ====================

### 3. 重复关注 — 对已关注的用户再次关注
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=3


### 4. 重复取关 — 对未关注的用户取关
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/remove
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=3


### ==================== 异常 — 参数校验 ====================

### 5. 关注自己
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=5


### 6. 取关自己
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/remove
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=1


### 7. 缺少 followedUserId
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded


### 8. followedUserId 不是数字
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/add
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=abc


### ==================== 异常 — 鉴权 ====================

### 9. 不带 token — AuthFilter 拦截
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/add
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=2


### 10. 伪造 token — AuthFilter 拦截
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/add
token: fake-token-12345
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=2


### ==================== 异常 — 路径 ====================

### 11. 未识别的 action
POST http://localhost:8080/MyAPP/follow/unknown
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

followedUserId=2
